<title>UK: Britain's Jarvis Porter buys Irish firm.</title>
<headline>Britain's Jarvis Porter buys Irish firm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Jarvis Porter Group Plc said on Tuesday it had bought Irish firm Industrial Print Group Ltd (IPG) for 9.34 million stg.</p>
<p>Jarvis, a specialist label printing company, said in a statement it would fund the purchase from cash resources. IPG is a labelling products supplier to the Irish electronics industry.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
